WEBVTT

01:27.865 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:40.265 --> 01:42.025
Farewell, Your Majesties.

01:43.905 --> 01:46.505
Today, we bid you farewell
as Bai Chifan and Lin Cangcang.

01:47.305 --> 01:49.785
Mr. Bai, did you succeed
in winning your beloved back?

01:49.865 --> 01:50.705
Isn't it obvious?

01:51.625 --> 01:55.505
Didn't you see the way
Miss Lin looked at Mr. Bai just now?

02:02.985 --> 02:06.425
Later, I will have a grand gift prepared
to thank Your Highness.

02:06.505 --> 02:07.505
All right.

02:08.025 --> 02:11.185
This journey to Xijiang
has taught me much.

02:12.505 --> 02:13.865
Thank you.

02:13.945 --> 02:15.945
Though parting is hard,
we have to say goodbye.

02:16.785 --> 02:18.425
-Take care.
-Take care.

02:24.865 --> 02:25.785
Let's go.

02:26.305 --> 02:27.305
Goodbye.

02:49.105 --> 02:52.225
Kumor,
I'll really miss Cangcang and Bai Chifan.

02:54.505 --> 02:55.785
What shall we do?

02:55.865 --> 02:59.025
Should we have them find
you a husband in the Capital?

03:00.225 --> 03:01.625
What are you talking about, Kumor?

03:02.825 --> 03:05.505
My silly sister has grown up.
She's actually blushing.

03:29.505 --> 03:30.665
Ying.

03:32.265 --> 03:33.905
Qianqing, here's the powder you wanted.

03:35.465 --> 03:37.025
You're amazing, Ying.

03:37.865 --> 03:40.625
I'll bring you a gift
when I come back, all right?

03:42.465 --> 03:43.905
Qianqing, take care of yourself.

04:17.384 --> 04:18.745
What are you doing?

04:18.825 --> 04:19.745
You scared me.

04:21.025 --> 04:21.865
Why are you here?

04:22.745 --> 04:24.985
This trip will be perilous.

04:26.065 --> 04:28.025
I was afraid
you wouldn't be able to handle it alone,

04:28.105 --> 04:30.785
so I decided to escort you myself.

04:32.385 --> 04:34.185
I have guards with me. You needn't
trouble yourself, Your Highness.

04:34.265 --> 04:35.505
Wait.

04:41.425 --> 04:43.505
You are a woman after all.

04:43.585 --> 04:45.545
Oh? You know that?

04:48.625 --> 04:50.305
Then why not spare me this mission?

04:50.385 --> 04:51.385
Go by yourself.

04:51.465 --> 04:52.305
That won't do.

04:55.705 --> 04:58.305
You know Xuzhou better than I do.

04:59.705 --> 05:03.265
I can't go without you, Master Zhong.

05:03.345 --> 05:04.385
What was that?

05:06.025 --> 05:07.065
Master Zhong.

05:10.425 --> 05:11.465
Let's go.

05:20.945 --> 05:23.185
Imperial Physician Li left the Capital
in secret two days ago.

05:23.265 --> 05:25.305
Track him immediately.

05:25.825 --> 05:27.745
I will wait for your report in Xuzhou.

05:29.985 --> 05:31.625
XUZHOU

05:38.105 --> 05:40.545
GOOD FORTUNE AND PROSPERITY

06:07.665 --> 06:08.625
This trip wasn't in vain.

06:09.785 --> 06:11.065
I can't believe the Governor of Xuzhou

06:11.665 --> 06:13.745
actually dared to tell such blatant lies.

06:14.505 --> 06:16.305
It's late autumn.
Winter is coming. Let's hurry.

06:16.385 --> 06:18.945
The sooner we reach Xuzhou,
the sooner we can distribute grain.

06:19.025 --> 06:21.385
Only with food to eat and strength
to work can the people endure the cold.

06:30.305 --> 06:33.145
YAMEN OF XUZHOU PREFECTURE

06:33.225 --> 06:35.505
I didn't sleep at all last night.

06:47.785 --> 06:49.025
Here they come. Come on.

06:49.625 --> 06:50.665
They're here.

06:56.105 --> 06:57.705
Greetings, Your Excellency.

07:15.545 --> 07:16.745
Who are you?

07:17.385 --> 07:19.385
I am Li Youlin, a county governor.

07:19.945 --> 07:21.585
The Governor of Xuzhou
committed suicide in prison out of guilt.

07:21.665 --> 07:25.305
I have temporarily taken his place
to handle Xuzhou's affairs.

07:25.385 --> 07:27.265
We were just talking about him.

07:27.785 --> 07:29.105
He killed himself already?

07:30.145 --> 07:32.625
Grand Tutor Ling really
intends to eliminate all loose ends.

07:33.665 --> 07:34.505
I see.

07:35.185 --> 07:37.585
Store half of the relief grain
in the prefecture granary

07:37.665 --> 07:40.025
and distribute the other half
according to the household registry.

07:40.625 --> 07:42.865
If I find any shortage or deception,

07:42.945 --> 07:44.625
I will punish without mercy.

07:45.785 --> 07:46.745
Rest assured, Your Excellency.

07:47.345 --> 07:49.425
I will have my men inventory
and process everything overnight.

07:50.225 --> 07:51.865
This is a special
locust-repelling powder from the palace.

07:52.465 --> 07:53.625
You may try it.

07:54.305 --> 07:55.545
If it works,

07:55.625 --> 07:58.545
I have the recipe, and you can have
it produced in large quantities.

07:59.545 --> 08:00.665
Understood.

08:02.705 --> 08:03.905
We've also been trying

08:03.985 --> 08:05.785
to drive the locusts away
with torches and wild ducks.

08:06.385 --> 08:09.505
Now, with this powder added,
there are three methods in total.

08:10.105 --> 08:12.265
We should see results soon.

08:15.025 --> 08:16.065
My Lord,

08:16.785 --> 08:17.945
word from the palace.

08:18.665 --> 08:19.865
The Prince of
Yuzhang secretly left the Capital.

08:21.105 --> 08:22.185
He left?

08:22.705 --> 08:24.105
Send men after him.

08:24.185 --> 08:25.945
Whatever Xiao Qianqing is planning,

08:26.025 --> 08:30.145
I will make sure he never rises again.

08:30.225 --> 08:32.985
POST STATION

08:42.784 --> 08:44.585
-Who is it?
-If you fail your task,

08:45.185 --> 08:46.945
the Lingbi Sect will never let you go.

09:03.145 --> 09:06.625
KILL THE PRINCE OF YUZHANG

10:05.785 --> 10:06.705
Zhong Lin,

10:09.345 --> 10:11.625
I am punishing you.

10:15.625 --> 10:16.785
Tell me,

10:17.905 --> 10:20.865
have you been trying to seduce me?

10:22.225 --> 10:23.305
Otherwise,

10:23.385 --> 10:26.985
why would I feel like I'm falling for you?

10:30.185 --> 10:33.545
I've never fallen

10:34.625 --> 10:36.505
for anyone before.

10:39.265 --> 10:41.105
Miss Zhong, you're brave and sharp.

10:41.185 --> 10:42.545
I've decided it's you.

10:42.625 --> 10:43.585
Be quick.

10:43.665 --> 10:47.345
My life is in your hands now,
Vice Sect Leader Zhong.

10:51.345 --> 10:52.345
Deal.

11:36.225 --> 11:37.185
Zhong Lin,

11:38.265 --> 11:39.905
why did you try to kill me?

11:43.945 --> 11:44.865
Thank you.

11:46.065 --> 11:47.465
Take it easy. There's enough for everyone.

11:47.545 --> 11:49.425
Give me some!

11:49.505 --> 11:51.185
-Get in line.
-Thank you.

11:51.265 --> 11:52.665
Thank you.

11:54.985 --> 11:56.865
-Here.
-Next.

11:56.945 --> 11:58.305
-Line up!
-Thank you.

11:58.385 --> 11:59.265
-No rush. You'll all get your share.
-No pushing!

12:00.065 --> 12:01.305
Get in line!

12:01.385 --> 12:02.305
Get in line!

12:02.825 --> 12:03.745
Don't push. There's plenty.

12:04.705 --> 12:05.865
Everyone, line up.

12:07.105 --> 12:08.105
No rush.

12:08.185 --> 12:10.185
Sir, please give me a little more.

12:10.265 --> 12:11.385
-Sir…
-Come here.

12:14.145 --> 12:15.825
-Stay in line!
-There's plenty!

12:22.225 --> 12:23.105
Don't push. You'll get your share.

12:23.185 --> 12:24.465
Please give me some.

12:27.105 --> 12:28.225
Don't push. There's plenty.

12:31.785 --> 12:33.025
Everyone will get some.

12:34.625 --> 12:36.865
We succeeded
because you rushed back in time.

12:36.945 --> 12:38.465
You deserve the top credit. Cheers.

12:40.225 --> 12:41.385
No need for that.

12:41.465 --> 12:43.865
Just keep your word
and let me see Cangcang.

12:44.505 --> 12:45.985
I don't want
Zhong Lin owing you any favors.

12:46.505 --> 12:48.505
I have one more favor to ask.

12:49.625 --> 12:50.465
Please look after her.

12:51.145 --> 12:52.265
Keep her from coming after me.

12:59.385 --> 13:01.265
Thank you, sir!

13:01.345 --> 13:03.105
We're out of congee. Please wait a moment.

13:03.905 --> 13:05.025
Stay in line, everyone!

13:06.225 --> 13:07.145
Here you are.

13:11.345 --> 13:12.265
What's wrong?

13:12.345 --> 13:13.465
Zhong Lin,

13:14.145 --> 13:15.745
you're not yourself today.

13:18.425 --> 13:20.585
-If you have time to stand here,
-Thank you.

13:20.665 --> 13:21.745
why not help us instead?

13:21.825 --> 13:24.785
I'm used to having everything done for me.

13:24.865 --> 13:26.385
Great acts of charity
like distributing congee

13:26.465 --> 13:28.145
should be left to Your Excellency.

13:29.825 --> 13:30.865
Here. Move aside.

13:32.105 --> 13:33.145
Is it ready yet, Madam?

13:33.225 --> 13:34.705
-Almost.
-I know you.

13:34.785 --> 13:35.745
Your name is Niqiu.

13:35.825 --> 13:37.345
You already got your congee.

13:37.425 --> 13:38.945
Everyone only gets one serving a day.
Move along.

13:39.025 --> 13:40.905
Sir, please,

13:40.985 --> 13:42.985
let me get some more. I'm really hungry.

13:43.065 --> 13:44.185
Don't you understand the rules?

13:44.265 --> 13:45.185
Get out of here!

13:46.825 --> 13:47.945
Your Highness.

13:48.025 --> 13:49.065
Careful.

13:51.545 --> 13:52.865
Did you hurt yourself?

13:54.185 --> 13:55.345
Here, take this.

13:55.425 --> 13:56.465
Go on home.

14:03.185 --> 14:04.705
Why are you looking at me like that?

14:05.585 --> 14:08.065
Did my gentle

14:08.145 --> 14:10.625
and benevolent nature stun you?

14:12.945 --> 14:14.065
Your Highness.

14:19.705 --> 14:20.985
What's wrong?

14:21.625 --> 14:22.465
Come with me.

14:24.705 --> 14:26.905
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

14:36.065 --> 14:40.065
-Bless us.
-Bless us.

14:47.145 --> 14:48.185
What are they worshipping?

14:49.145 --> 14:50.025
The Tudigong?

14:50.105 --> 14:52.305
Your Highness, that's no Tudigong.

14:52.385 --> 14:53.545
It's the Locust Lord.

14:54.225 --> 14:55.065
The Locust Lord?

14:56.265 --> 14:57.385
That's absurd.

14:57.465 --> 15:00.225
Why would anyone worship
something that only brings disaster?

15:00.305 --> 15:02.385
Common folk have long seen
locust plagues as divine punishment.

15:02.905 --> 15:07.105
They believe only sincere prayers
will earn mercy and end the plague.

15:07.705 --> 15:11.345
Why didn't you officials do anything
to stop such absurd rumors?

15:11.945 --> 15:13.465
People were uncertain at first.

15:14.145 --> 15:15.265
But after the Governor of Xuzhou

15:15.345 --> 15:17.545
suddenly killed himself in prison,

15:18.225 --> 15:21.585
they became convinced their worship
moved the Locust Lord

15:21.665 --> 15:22.985
to deliver justice,

15:23.585 --> 15:25.425
so things kept escalating.

15:26.025 --> 15:28.625
"Know the enemy and know yourself,
and you'll never lose."

15:28.705 --> 15:30.825
We should head back

15:30.905 --> 15:32.025
and come up with a plan.

15:33.025 --> 15:34.265
Where are you going?

15:34.345 --> 15:37.505
I didn't haul grain all the way to Xuzhou

15:37.585 --> 15:39.865
just to let them
offer it to a swarm of bugs!

15:39.945 --> 15:41.505
-What are you planning to do?
-Out of the way!

15:48.025 --> 15:48.745
What are you doing?

15:50.305 --> 15:52.425
Everyone! Everyone,

15:52.505 --> 15:54.345
-please listen to me!
-Locust Lord!

15:54.425 --> 15:56.345
The Governor of Xuzhou has
confessed and paid for his crimes,

15:56.945 --> 15:58.825
and we've found a way to end the plague.

15:59.545 --> 16:00.745
The grain distributed by the government

16:00.825 --> 16:02.825
is to get you through the famine,

16:03.425 --> 16:04.705
not to be offered

16:04.785 --> 16:07.305
to the very pest that caused it!

16:07.905 --> 16:10.025
Please get up and take your grain home.

16:10.625 --> 16:12.265
-Madam, get up.
-Liar!

16:12.345 --> 16:15.185
You officials are the ones who harmed us!

16:15.265 --> 16:16.265
You…

16:16.345 --> 16:18.385
If that wretched
governor hadn't stolen our grain,

16:18.465 --> 16:19.705
would we be starving now?

16:21.545 --> 16:23.745
-Nonsense!
-The Locust Lord

16:24.425 --> 16:26.065
is our guardian spirit!

16:26.145 --> 16:27.305
It punished

16:27.385 --> 16:30.065
the Governor of Xuzhou for us!

16:30.145 --> 16:31.025
Anger the Locust Lord,

16:31.105 --> 16:32.305
you'll suffer retribution!

16:32.385 --> 16:33.625
You…

16:39.985 --> 16:41.385
They look down on the Locust Lord

16:41.465 --> 16:43.825
-because they don't want us to live well!
-Exactly!

16:43.905 --> 16:44.945
-That's right!
-Move aside!

16:45.025 --> 16:46.905
Calm down! Everyone, listen to me!

16:46.985 --> 16:48.105
It's not like that!

16:48.625 --> 16:50.065
How dare he?

16:50.825 --> 16:52.265
-Listen to me…
-Beat him!

16:52.345 --> 16:53.425
Listen…

17:15.865 --> 17:17.385
The darn official is attacking people!

17:18.345 --> 17:19.424
He's attacking people!

17:19.505 --> 17:20.585
-Step back!
-Step back!

17:20.665 --> 17:21.464
Beat him up!

17:21.545 --> 17:23.184
How can they attack people?

17:24.184 --> 17:25.265
Beat him!

17:25.345 --> 17:26.385
-Catch them!
-Let's go.

17:27.424 --> 17:28.825
Don't let them get away!

17:28.905 --> 17:29.985
Catch them!

17:30.065 --> 17:30.985
After them!

17:38.305 --> 17:40.305
Stop! Don't run!

17:41.185 --> 17:42.985
They're up ahead! Hurry, catch them!

17:45.465 --> 17:46.665
-Hurry!
-Stop!

17:48.105 --> 17:49.025
Come on!

17:52.505 --> 17:53.345
Where are they?

17:53.425 --> 17:55.025
-Over there!
-That way!

17:55.705 --> 17:56.745
-Hurry!
-Hurry!

17:57.505 --> 17:58.825
-Hurry up!
-That way!

17:58.905 --> 17:59.865
Hurry!

18:04.105 --> 18:05.745
Mr. Song, I'll draw the crowd away.

18:05.825 --> 18:06.865
-You protect His Highness and leave.
-All right.

18:06.945 --> 18:08.905
-Be careful.
-There they are!

18:08.985 --> 18:10.225
-Run!
-Let's go!

18:13.705 --> 18:14.585
Where did they go?

18:14.665 --> 18:15.545
Search!

18:16.385 --> 18:17.545
Hurry up…

18:17.625 --> 18:19.145
Stop right there!

18:23.585 --> 18:24.705
I'll hold them off. Go!

18:24.785 --> 18:26.345
No. We leave together.

18:26.425 --> 18:27.905
-Catch them!
-Come on.

18:27.985 --> 18:28.945
-Don't run!
-Stop!

18:38.025 --> 18:38.865
This way.

18:38.945 --> 18:40.785
-Stop!
-Stop!

18:40.865 --> 18:42.145
-Come on.
-Stop right there!

18:44.545 --> 18:45.545
They're over there!

18:46.505 --> 18:47.625
Don't run!

18:47.705 --> 18:48.705
Stop!

18:50.225 --> 18:51.185
That way! Hurry!

18:57.945 --> 18:59.105
Let's go.

19:10.825 --> 19:11.705
Search.

19:17.785 --> 19:18.625
Boss,

19:19.945 --> 19:21.065
they're not in the house.

19:22.465 --> 19:23.385
Keep looking!

20:05.585 --> 20:08.105
Xiao Qianqing. Wake up, Xiao Qianqing.

20:19.625 --> 20:21.425
Xiao Qianqing, wake up!

20:31.545 --> 20:33.585
Complete the mission and you'll be free.

20:36.065 --> 20:39.345
If I kill you, I'll be free.

20:50.025 --> 20:53.665
If you fail your task,
the Lingbi Sect will never let you go.

20:55.425 --> 20:57.665
KILL THE PRINCE OF YUZHANG

21:47.025 --> 21:49.265
-Did you find them?
-Sir, no trace of them anywhere.

21:49.945 --> 21:51.705
Where are they?
How could they just vanish?

21:52.305 --> 21:55.105
Sir, a search is underway,

21:55.185 --> 21:56.025
but we

21:58.225 --> 22:00.185
haven't found anything yet.

22:01.505 --> 22:04.545
Please grant us more time.

22:05.225 --> 22:06.185
We can't wait any longer.

22:06.745 --> 22:09.065
Arrest every person
who was worshipping that Locust Lord!

22:09.665 --> 22:10.825
Interrogate them. Torture them.

22:10.905 --> 22:12.225
We'll see how long they can hold out!

22:12.985 --> 22:14.825
But… Sir,

22:15.345 --> 22:18.425
there were far too many people.
It isn't realistic

22:19.385 --> 22:20.825
to arrest them all.

22:22.665 --> 22:24.425
Do you know who is missing?

22:24.505 --> 22:25.465
I'll be honest.

22:25.545 --> 22:26.865
It's not just the Imperial Commissioner.
There's also…

22:30.145 --> 22:31.265
Also who?

22:31.865 --> 22:32.785
In short,

22:32.865 --> 22:33.785
someone you can't afford to offend!

22:35.345 --> 22:36.185
Listen closely.

22:36.785 --> 22:38.785
From now on, no eating, no drinking,

22:38.865 --> 22:40.225
and no rest until you find them!

22:40.305 --> 22:41.585
Turn the place upside down if you have to!

22:41.665 --> 22:42.545
Is that clear?

22:43.065 --> 22:43.905
Yes!

23:09.465 --> 23:10.305
Careful.

23:14.465 --> 23:15.745
You're hurt.

23:19.345 --> 23:20.385
Where are we?

23:21.465 --> 23:22.785
We fell into a dry well.

23:26.225 --> 23:27.585
I can't believe those people…

23:32.105 --> 23:33.185
This time, it's my fault.

23:34.745 --> 23:36.105
Had I not provoked them,

23:36.185 --> 23:38.425
you wouldn't be injured
or trapped down here.

23:51.185 --> 23:52.145
I'm hungry.

23:54.985 --> 23:55.865
You heard me.

23:56.385 --> 23:58.505
Hurry and figure out a way out.

24:00.705 --> 24:04.225
I've already checked. The well isn't deep,

24:04.905 --> 24:07.705
and there are stone bricks we can climb.

24:09.625 --> 24:11.905
But in our condition,

24:12.425 --> 24:13.785
we probably can't make it up.

24:19.465 --> 24:20.825
Then how about this?

24:22.225 --> 24:24.465
Shout for help.

24:24.545 --> 24:26.185
Maybe someone will hear you,

24:26.265 --> 24:27.705
-and we'll be saved.
-What?

24:27.785 --> 24:28.745
Why don't you shout?

24:29.905 --> 24:31.025
Me?

24:33.265 --> 24:35.145
My arm hurts.

24:36.465 --> 24:37.985
So troublesome.

24:38.985 --> 24:41.865
If I'd known,
I would've just killed you earlier.

24:48.905 --> 24:50.345
Why are you still staring at me?

24:50.425 --> 24:51.785
Hurry up and shout.

24:52.305 --> 24:53.425
If you wait any longer,

24:54.425 --> 24:56.065
my arm will break.

24:59.785 --> 25:00.865
Help.

25:01.785 --> 25:03.425
Louder.

25:07.745 --> 25:09.065
Help!

25:09.985 --> 25:11.865
Is anyone there?

25:13.665 --> 25:14.865
Help!

25:17.625 --> 25:19.465
Help!

25:20.585 --> 25:23.225
Is anyone there?

25:23.825 --> 25:26.025
Come and help us!

25:38.905 --> 25:40.265
All right, enough.

25:41.465 --> 25:44.825
In a deserted yard like this,
no one's coming.

25:45.585 --> 25:46.545
Save your strength.

25:47.265 --> 25:49.065
Why didn't you say so earlier?

25:49.145 --> 25:49.985
You said

25:50.585 --> 25:53.705
I ended up like this because of you.

25:53.785 --> 25:54.905
So what's wrong with
making you shout a bit?

26:00.145 --> 26:01.185
Something's not right.

26:07.545 --> 26:10.185
Your Highness, you didn't
seem surprised at all when they rioted.

26:15.465 --> 26:17.665
You knew this trip would be dangerous,

26:18.585 --> 26:20.345
so why did you insist on coming with me?

26:24.905 --> 26:27.425
I had my reasons.

26:29.225 --> 26:30.505
What reasons?

26:30.585 --> 26:31.585
To protect you.

26:36.145 --> 26:39.545
You've helped me so many times.
I can't let you walk into danger alone.

27:00.425 --> 27:01.585
Stop sitting there.

27:01.665 --> 27:02.705
Come here.

27:04.305 --> 27:06.265
Here's the plan:

27:06.345 --> 27:08.705
step on me and jump.

27:08.785 --> 27:10.745
See if you can grab the vines
and climb out.

27:12.265 --> 27:13.505
What about you?

27:13.585 --> 27:15.905
I'll stay and wait for you to bring help.

27:25.985 --> 27:29.145
Don't… don't get sentimental.

27:29.225 --> 27:32.305
I only said that
because I have an important task,

27:32.385 --> 27:34.625
and a little sacrifice is necessary.

27:34.705 --> 27:36.425
Once you get out,

27:36.505 --> 27:38.705
bring people back immediately.

27:44.545 --> 27:45.785
Understand?

27:49.345 --> 27:50.505
Yes.

28:26.345 --> 28:27.305
I'm sorry.

28:28.345 --> 28:29.585
I don't want to kill you,

28:31.105 --> 28:32.585
but I can't let you live either.

28:57.745 --> 28:59.025
We part ways here.

29:00.425 --> 29:01.905
Whether you survive

29:02.745 --> 29:04.225
depends on yourself now.

29:26.065 --> 29:27.145
Sir…

29:33.225 --> 29:36.665
You saw the Ghost King Token.
Why are you still hesitating?

29:36.745 --> 29:41.105
The Ghost King has just passed away,
and you've already forgotten your place?

29:42.625 --> 29:44.425
I wouldn't dare. Please, sir, spare me.

29:44.505 --> 29:47.145
Remember the fate of traitors.

29:56.825 --> 29:57.665
Spare me, sir!

29:58.705 --> 30:00.425
As long as you live,

30:00.505 --> 30:01.665
no matter where you go,

30:02.425 --> 30:04.305
you must stay loyal to the Lingbi Sect.

30:09.385 --> 30:11.105
Go and kill Xiao Qianqing.

30:51.865 --> 30:53.465
What took you so long?

31:08.065 --> 31:09.025
Xiao Qianqing,

31:11.145 --> 31:13.185
you're the first person
who ever said you had feelings for me.

31:13.825 --> 31:16.825
But you and I
belong to two different worlds.

31:16.905 --> 31:18.505
One of us must die.

31:18.585 --> 31:19.665
Even if I don't kill you,

31:21.425 --> 31:23.505
they'll send someone else.

31:25.745 --> 31:27.425
I can only buy you some time.

31:28.385 --> 31:29.985
Once the Xuzhou matter is settled,

31:30.705 --> 31:33.465
we'll go our separate ways.

31:34.465 --> 31:36.465
Fate is to blame.

31:39.545 --> 31:41.305
Just pretend

31:42.945 --> 31:44.105
there was never a Zhong Lin in this world.

31:44.185 --> 31:45.145
Mr. Song!

31:45.705 --> 31:46.745
Mr. Song!

31:48.985 --> 31:50.225
Mr. Song!

31:50.305 --> 31:52.185
Come quickly! Mr. Song is here!

31:54.625 --> 31:55.625
Are you all right?

32:04.465 --> 32:06.785
Divine spirit above, hear our plea.

32:06.865 --> 32:09.305
We were reckless earlier and offended you.

32:09.905 --> 32:11.145
We beg your forgiveness.

32:11.745 --> 32:14.425
Now, I, Song Lanxi,
together with the people of Xuzhou,

32:14.505 --> 32:15.625
humbly pray

32:15.705 --> 32:18.825
for blessings and safety,

32:18.905 --> 32:20.745
and for the locust
plague to be dispelled soon.

32:33.225 --> 32:34.985
I have received an edict
from the Shrine of Great Qi.

32:35.585 --> 32:38.065
Today, I lead
the people in sincere prayer,

32:38.785 --> 32:40.825
seeking the descent of the divine spirit

32:40.905 --> 32:41.865
to deliver us from hardship.

32:50.625 --> 32:52.225
Who is that?

33:02.745 --> 33:04.065
The deity has manifested!

33:04.145 --> 33:05.345
Bow!

33:05.425 --> 33:06.545
A manifestation!

33:06.625 --> 33:08.065
Oh, deity!

33:08.145 --> 33:10.105
Please save us, deity!

33:12.985 --> 33:15.625
Filled with compassion for all beings,

33:15.705 --> 33:17.865
I traverse the mortal world.

33:18.665 --> 33:20.745
Passing through this place,

33:20.825 --> 33:23.105
I saw Xuzhou ravaged by disaster

33:23.185 --> 33:24.905
and its people in misery.

33:25.425 --> 33:29.065
In honor of your sincere prayers,

33:29.145 --> 33:31.305
I bestow upon you this Immortal Dew.

33:38.625 --> 33:40.985
Scatter it upon the locusts,

33:41.865 --> 33:43.745
and the plague will be dispelled.

33:45.545 --> 33:47.465
Thank you for your divine grace.

33:53.865 --> 33:55.505
Scatter the Immortal Dew
to eliminate the locusts.

33:55.585 --> 33:56.425
Understood.

34:00.705 --> 34:02.705
We're saved by the deity's blessing!

34:10.585 --> 34:11.625
Wait!

34:11.705 --> 34:12.625
He's a fake!

34:12.705 --> 34:14.865
Why would a deity
be wearing official boots?

34:14.945 --> 34:16.304
Don't let him fool you!

34:17.185 --> 34:19.145
I've been waiting for you! Seize him!

34:19.744 --> 34:20.625
Arrest him!

34:26.945 --> 34:27.985
Get them!

35:05.105 --> 35:06.625
KILL THE PRINCE OF YUZHANG

35:09.745 --> 35:13.545
Why would I feel like I'm falling for you?

35:20.865 --> 35:21.785
Look out!

37:19.465 --> 37:21.105
I, Li Youlin,

37:22.025 --> 37:23.825
together with the people of Xuzhou,

37:23.905 --> 37:26.465
am here to see Mr. Song off.

37:27.105 --> 37:30.145
Mr. Song traveled far to deliver grain

37:30.225 --> 37:32.185
and gave his all.

37:36.905 --> 37:39.145
We will never forget

37:39.905 --> 37:42.025
his life-saving grace!

37:43.745 --> 37:44.945
Mr. Song,

37:45.505 --> 37:47.585
may you rest in peace!

38:25.745 --> 38:27.225
Keep moving!

39:05.785 --> 39:06.985
What are you planning to do?

39:10.825 --> 39:11.905
Your life

39:13.105 --> 39:14.025
is in my hands now.

39:19.465 --> 39:20.825
I have only one question:

39:21.705 --> 39:23.105
who are you, really?

39:38.185 --> 39:39.465
What do you mean?

39:41.025 --> 39:42.585
I'm Zhong Lin. Who else would I be?

39:45.025 --> 39:45.985
Is that so?

40:07.865 --> 40:09.585
Then why did you try to assassinate me?

40:21.465 --> 40:22.465
I…

40:26.025 --> 40:27.105
I thought

40:28.265 --> 40:29.785
I could finally escape my past.

40:30.705 --> 40:31.945
But as it turned out,

40:33.545 --> 40:36.225
I could never break free
from being someone else's pawn.

40:37.665 --> 40:38.745
Whose pawn?

40:39.625 --> 40:40.465
The Lingbi Sect?

40:44.105 --> 40:45.305
There's no point in saying more.

40:46.305 --> 40:47.585
Your Highness, kill me.

41:00.065 --> 41:01.145
If that's the case,

41:02.705 --> 41:03.785
don't blame me.

41:12.345 --> 41:14.865
I am Zhong Lin, Vice Sect Leader
of Fenglai Pavilion.

41:14.945 --> 41:17.545
I'm willing to serve
Your Highness with all my heart.

41:49.625 --> 41:50.545
Go.

41:57.465 --> 41:58.625
Song Lanxi is dead.

41:59.385 --> 42:00.705
You are free again.

42:02.665 --> 42:03.825
From now on,

42:04.945 --> 42:06.225
you are not Song Lanxi.

42:07.585 --> 42:08.425
Nor are you Zhong Lin.

42:10.545 --> 42:11.745
You can be yourself.

42:14.945 --> 42:17.065
No one will ever use you as a pawn again.

42:28.105 --> 42:29.145
Go!
